1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
مرحبا اصدقائي، سلام الله عليكم جميعا.
 
Hello friends, God's peace be upon you all.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
وردة اليوم من بستان ناحية راجو.
 
Today's flower is from the garden of Rajo district.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
گوندی حەسەن او قرية حسن كلكاوي او الحسنية.
 
Gundî Hesen, or Hasan Kalkawi village, or Al-Hasaniyah.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
قرية كردية في جبل الكرد، تتبع ناحية راجو إداريا منطقة عفرين.
 
A Kurdish village in Mount Kurd, administratively belonging
to Rajo district, Afrin region.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
وتبعد عنها ستة كيلومتر،
 
It is 6 kilometers away from it,

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
وترتفع عن سطح البحر حوالي 885 متر،
 
And its elevation from sea level is about 885 meters,

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
وعمرها حوالي 300 عام،
 
And its age is about 300 years.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
يتكلم سكانها اللغة الكردية،
 
Its inhabitants speak the Kurdish language,

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,000
ويعودون باصولهم الى عشيرة شيخاني الكردية.
 
And they trace their origins back to the Kurdish Shekhani
tribe.

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:46,000
گوندی حەسەن قرية صغيرة، على مرتفع كلسي،
 
Gundî Hesen is a small village, on a calcareous highland,

11
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
في موقع جميل للغاية،
 
In a very beautiful location,

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:57,000
والتسمية كردية نسبة الى اسم العلم حسن.
 
And the name is Kurdish, in reference to the proper name
Hasan.

13
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:02,000
ويحدها منحدرات مزروعة باشجار الزيتون،
 
It is bordered by slopes planted with olive trees,

14
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:08,000
ووادي سيلي، مزروعة باشجار الزيتون والبلوط والبطم،
 
And a torrential valley, planted with olive, oak, and
terebinth trees,

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
وبالكردية كَوسون،
 
And in Kurdish, Gewson.

16
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,000
ويحدها كل من قرية قدا، قداكوي،
 
It is bordered by the villages of Qada, Qadakoy,

17
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:23,000
ودوريش، دوريش اوباسي،
 
Dewrish, Dewrish Obasi,

18
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,000
عمارو، عمار اوشاغي.
 
'Amaro, 'Amar Oshaghi.

19
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,000
تحوي من 70 الى 75 بيتا،
 
It contains from 70 to 75 houses,

20
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:35,000
منها قديمة طينية بسقوف خشبية واخرى اسمنتية حديثة.
 
Some of them are old mud houses with wooden roofs, and
others are modern cement ones.

21
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:40,000
يعمل سكانها الى جانب العلم، بالزراعة البعلية كالزيتون
والكرمة،
 
Its inhabitants work, alongside seeking knowledge, in
rainfed agriculture like olives and vines,

22
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,000
الى جانب تربية المواشي.
 
In addition to raising livestock.

23
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,000
اصدقائي كانت هذه وقفة سريعة وجميلة،
 
My friends, this was a quick and beautiful stop,

24
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,000
بتمنى تنال اعجابكم.
 
I hope you like it.

25
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,000
أهالي قرية حسن كلكاوي،
 
People of Hasan Kalkawi village,

26
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:55,000
لكم مني انا ابنتكم بيان علي كل المحبة والتقدير،
 
You have all the love and appreciation from me, your
daughter Bayan Ali,

27
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,000
ولقريتكم السلام والامان.
 
And peace and security for your village.

28
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:00,000
كانت معكم بيان علي، بنت عفرين.
 
Bayan Ali, the daughter of Afrin, was with you.

29
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:20,000
باي باي، تحياتي لكم جميعا.
 
Bye bye, my greetings to you all.

30
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:37,000
Bê sebeb o sirra dila, dost te veşartî.
 
Without reason, the secret of the hearts, friend you hid it.

31
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Ev çend sal in bi dizî yarê, me kulên te hilgirtî.
 
For a few years secretly, my love, I've carried your sorrow.

32
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Bê sebeb o sirra dila, dost te veşartî.
 
Without reason, the secret of the hearts, friend you hid it.

33
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:07,000
Ev çend sal in bi dizî sebrê, me kulên te hilgirtî.
 
For a few years secretly, my patience, I've carried your
sorrow.

34
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Bes e lawo hezkirinê, dostê te kir dîn.
 
Enough boy, this loving, the friend has made you crazy.

35
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Eman dila megrî megrî, ev çi hal e megrî megrî.
 
Mercy oh heart don't cry don't cry, what is this state,
don't cry don't cry.

36
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:32,000
Ev çi hal e megrî megrî, megrî megrî dost.
 
What is this state don't cry don't cry, don't cry don't cry
friend.

37
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Bes e lawo hezkirinê, dostê te kir dîn.
 
Enough boy, this loving, the friend has made you crazy.

38
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Eman dila megrî megrî, ev çi hal e megrî megrî.
 
Mercy oh heart don't cry don't cry, what is this state,
don't cry don't cry.

39
00:03:47,000 --> 00:04:07,000
Ev çi zeman e megrî megrî, megrî megrî dost.
 
What time is this don't cry don't cry, don't cry don't cry
friend.

40
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:55,000
Teyrekî zozana bû, te bi feqê xistî.
 
It was a bird of the highlands, you caught it in a trap.

41
00:04:55,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Sirrekî veşartî bû, te bi xelkê xistî.
 
It was a hidden secret, you exposed it to the people.

